&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of U.S. Government Pricing regulations and reporting requirements, including AMP, Best Price, ASP, Medicaid Rebates, 340B, Non-FAMP, FCP, and Federal Supply Schedule programs.&lt;/li&gt;
