&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting product launches and commercialization efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Government Pricing and Contract Management systems such as Model N, Revitas, SAP, or similar platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of emerging government pricing regulations, including Inflation Reduction Act (IRA) requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
