&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This role reports directly to the Chief Commercial Officer (CCO) and works in close daily partnership with the Commercial Leadership Team. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Working directly with the CCO, this leader will serve as a trusted strategic thought partner and force multiplier to the CCO and Commercial Leadership Team. The role will help frame and resolve the most important strategic, organizational, and operational questions facing Commercial, lead high-priority initiatives, and ensure critical decisions translate into coordinated action.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a broad, highly visible role for a leader who combines strategic rigor with strong execution. The successful candidate will be comfortable tackling ambiguous problems, influencing senior stakeholders without formal authority, simplifying complexity, and moving fluidly between enterprise-level questions and hands-on delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The role offers the opportunity to help build a Commercial organization at a pivotal stage in Dyne&#39;s evolution, with direct exposure to the CCO, Commercial Leadership Team, Executive&amp;nbsp;Committee, and Board.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
