n data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body&quot;&gt; planning.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body&quot;&gt;Areas&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body&quot;&gt; of responsibility include Phase IV studies, real-world evidence, observational re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body&quot;&gt;search, secondary and exploratory analyses of clinical development data, investigator-sponsored research,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body&quot;&gt;clinical outcomes assessment (PRO/HRQoL)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body&quot;&gt;HEOR and value evidence activities, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body&quot;&gt;scientific publications, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body&quot;&gt;congress presentations, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body&quot;&gt;and other Medical Affairs &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body&quot;&gt;evidence-generation &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body&quot;&gt;initiatives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body&quot;&gt; The role requires &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body&quot;&gt;the ability to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body&quot;&gt;operate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body&quot;&gt; with &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body&quot;&gt;a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body&quot;&gt;high degree of independence, influence cross-functional and senior stakeholders, translate complex statistical concepts into actionable insights, and build scalable processes, standards, and capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body&quot;&gt; Experience in rare disease drug development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body&quot;&gt;, preferably neuromuscular disease, is preferred&lt;/