&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f1iaxwol&quot;&gt;The Senior Manager, US Medical Affairs supports execution of Dyne’s US Medical Affairs strategy for the Duchenne Muscular Dystrophy (DMD) program. This role contributes to critical launch readiness activities and supports the planning and delivery of US Medical initiatives, including KOL engagement, congress execution, medical education efforts, and cross-functional coordination.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f1iaxwol&quot;&gt;The Senior Manager operates as both a scientific and operational contributor, helping prepare the US Medical organization for anticipated DMD program needs. This role partners closely with Medical Science Liaisons (MSLs), Global Medical Affairs, and cross-functional stakeholders to ensure medical activities are high-quality, compliant, and impactful.&lt;/div&gt;
